    {
      "id": 9622889922804,
      "title": "Yutu Window Case",
      "handle": "yutu-tcg-window-case",
      "bodyHtml": "<p>A case you dress. A card you change.</p>\n<p>Transparent window. Standard 63×88, same as a standard TCG card. Made in Hong Kong. Not a lock.</p>\n<p><strong>How it works</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Slide a 63×88 into the window. A 图鉴 print, or a card you already own.</li>\n<li>Put the case on the phone.</li>\n<li>Tomorrow, swap the face.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>In the box: the case, plus one pictorial-book 63×88 print — pick the face at checkout. <a href=\"https://jubuddy.com/pictorial-book\">jubuddy.com/pictorial-book</a></p>\n<p>made to order · 7–14 days · Hong Kong</p>\n<p>The case is a frame. We do not sell other people’s cards. Not affiliated with Showcased.</p>\n<p><strong>From the pictorial book</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Printable faces: <a href=\"https://tekoart.com/pages/faces\">tekoart.com/pages/faces</a> — Juju, Qilin, Yutu only.</li>\n<li>Qilin in the book: <a href=\"https://jubuddy.com/pictorial-book/creature/qilin?series=plush-pocket-monster\">qilin</a>\n</li>\n<li>Yutu in the book: <a href=\"https://jubuddy.com/pictorial-book/creature/rabbit-yutu?series=plush-pocket-monster\">rabbit-yutu</a> (shop slug is yutu)</li>\n<li>意境 walk, not a SKU: <a href=\"https://tekoart.com/pages/poetry\">tekoart.com/pages/poetry</a>\n</li>\n<li>/jub create is extra, not in this order: <a href=\"https://jubuddy.com/jub?screen=create\">jubuddy.com/jub?screen=create</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Juju is the shop pig, not book #001.</p>\n",
